# Build context for deploy/docker/Dockerfile. The image runs npm ci itself
# so the host node_modules (Windows) never enter the Linux image.
node_modules
**/node_modules
data
**/data
tmp
**/tmp
artifacts
**/artifacts
.git
.claude
coverage
**/coverage
**/*.log
docs/compose/samples
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
